<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>

	<!-- Settings -->
	<!-- EN: Prevent animals from eating random stuff -->
  <ALConfigCuriosityEatingLabel>防止动物乱吃东西</ALConfigCuriosityEatingLabel>
	<!-- EN: It mostly prevents your animals from eating drugs without a nutrition and stuff outside their allowed zones. They would still eat your food if it is in their allowed zone. -->
  <ALConfigCuriosityEatingTooltip>这选项主要是防止你的动物吃没有营养的成瘾品和在它们的允许活动范围以外的东西。如果食物在它们的允许活动范围内，动物仍然会吃。</ALConfigCuriosityEatingTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Predators hunting your pawns are considered hostile by your entire faction -->
  <ALConfigHostilePredatorsLabel>捕猎殖民地动物和殖民者的野生掠食者将被成为敌对目标</ALConfigHostilePredatorsLabel>
	<!-- EN: This does not change threat response of your pawns, it only makes them able to recognize a threat. -->
  <ALConfigHostilePredatorsTooltip>这个选项不会改变殖民者对威胁的反应，这只会让他们能够识别一个威胁。</ALConfigHostilePredatorsTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Convert eggs ruined by temperature into unfertilized chicken eggs -->
  <ALConfigEggConversionLabel>把因极端温度损坏的各种蛋变成未受精的鸡蛋</ALConfigEggConversionLabel>
	<!-- EN: This does not affect already ruined eggs. -->
  <ALConfigEggConversionTooltip>这个选项并不会影响使用此选项之前的就已受损的蛋。</ALConfigEggConversionTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Convert any generic animal meat into chicken meat upon butchering -->
  <ALConfigMeatConversionLabel>屠宰时将任何动物的肉转换成鸡肉。</ALConfigMeatConversionLabel>
	<!-- EN: This does not affect already butchered meat. -->
  <ALConfigMeatConversionTooltip>这个选项并不影响使用此选项之前就已屠宰产生的肉类。</ALConfigMeatConversionTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Harvest wool when butchering -->
  <ALConfigShearCorpsesLabel>屠宰时收获毛料</ALConfigShearCorpsesLabel>
	<!-- EN: Only works with vanilla "shearable", not exotic resource used by some mods. -->
  <ALConfigShearCorpsesTooltip>仅适用于原版游戏中的“可剪毛”动物，不适用于某些模组添加的稀有产物。</ALConfigShearCorpsesTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Medical alerts for animals -->
  <ALConfigMedicalAlertsLabel>动物急救警报</ALConfigMedicalAlertsLabel>
	<!-- EN: Shows right-hand alerts for when colony animals are injured, need rescuing or in critical medical condition. -->
  <ALConfigMedicalAlertsTooltip>当殖民地动物受伤、需要救援或需要急救时，会在屏幕右侧显示警报。</ALConfigMedicalAlertsTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Wildness threshold for tameness decay {0}%. Vanilla: 10.1%. -->
  <ALConfigTamenessDecayThresholdLabel>开启训练度衰减机制的野性阈值{0}%。（野性高于此阈值的动物才会产生训练度衰减。原版：10.1%。）</ALConfigTamenessDecayThresholdLabel>
	<!-- EN: Set to 100% to prevent losing tameness for all animals. -->
  <ALConfigTamenessDecayThresholdTooltip>当设置为100%时，所有动物的训练度都不会衰减。</ALConfigTamenessDecayThresholdTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Training decay speed {0}. Vanilla: 100%. -->
  <ALConfigTrainingDecaySpeedFactorLabel>训练度衰减速度{0}。原版：100%。</ALConfigTrainingDecaySpeedFactorLabel><!-- No % after wildcard is intentional. -->
	<!-- EN: Set to 1% to make it as slow as possible. -->
  <ALConfigTrainingDecaySpeedFactorTooltip>当设置为1%时，训练衰减速度将极为缓慢。</ALConfigTrainingDecaySpeedFactorTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Tags for animals in trade and caravan interfaces -->
  <ALConfigTradeHintsLabel>动物在贸易和商队界面的标签</ALConfigTradeHintsLabel>
	<!-- EN: Shows animal's sex, training and wool growth. -->
  <ALConfigTradeHintsTooltip>显示动物性别，训练度和毛发生长情况。</ALConfigTradeHintsTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Allow animals to use nutrient paste dispenser -->
  <ALConfigAnimalsCanUseFoodDispenserLabel>允许动物使用营养膏合成机</ALConfigAnimalsCanUseFoodDispenserLabel>
	<!-- EN: Animals would be capable of pressing that button. Warining: contains a minor detour (extremely unlikely chance to have a conflict). If animals still don't use the dispenser, check if the building iself is in the allowed area. -->
  <ALConfigAnimalsCanUseFoodDispenserTooltip>动物也将会使用合成机按钮。注意：此处有极低概率会造成冲突。如果选择后动物仍然不会使用合成机，请检查建筑是否在允许活动区域内。</ALConfigAnimalsCanUseFoodDispenserTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Hauling MTB {0}h. Vanilla: 1.5h. -->
  <ALConfigHaulingMTBLabel>搬运MTB{0}h.原版:1.5h.</ALConfigHaulingMTBLabel>
	<!-- EN: 'MTB' stands for 'Mean Time Between'. Setting to 0 drastically increases productiveness, but can affect performance with large amount of trained animals. -->
  <ALConfigHaulingMTBTooltip>“MTB”代表“随机搬运间隔时间”。设置为0可以显著提高搬运效率，但会影响动物逻辑。</ALConfigHaulingMTBTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Show extra stats for pawns -->
  <ALConfigShowExtraDisplayStatsLabel>显示额外动物统计信息</ALConfigShowExtraDisplayStatsLabel>
	<!-- EN: Shows some stats that vanilla misses, like resource production. -->
  <ALConfigShowExtraDisplayStatsTooltip>显示一些原版未显示的信息，例如产出信息等。</ALConfigShowExtraDisplayStatsTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Always show animal relations -->
  <ALConfigAlwaysShowRelationsLabel>总是显示动物亲缘关系</ALConfigAlwaysShowRelationsLabel>
	<!-- EN: By default, only relations with named animals are displayed. This allows to see all of them. -->
  <ALConfigAlwaysShowRelationsTooltip>默认情况下，只有被命名的动物会显示亲缘关系。这个选项会显示所有动物的亲缘关系。</ALConfigAlwaysShowRelationsTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Toxic buildup rot chance multiplier: {0}% -->
  <ALConfigToxicBuildupRotLabel>中毒死亡腐烂概率修正</ALConfigToxicBuildupRotLabel>
	<!-- EN: By default, animals killed while having major toxic buildup have a chance to rot immediately. It is intended to make toxic fallout more difficult, but has a side effect of cobras being unable to eat their prey, so they tend to kill every small animal on map and die from starvation. Set to 0% to entirely remove rot chance, set to 100% for vanilla formula. -->
  <ALConfigToxicBuildupRotTooltip>默认情况下，当处于中毒状态的动物死亡时有一定概率立即腐烂。此设定的目的是提高有毒尘埃事件难度，但有一个副作用，被眼镜蛇捕猎的动物也有一个中毒状态，同样可能在死亡时触发立即腐烂，这导致眼镜蛇获取食物困难，所以他们往往会杀死地图上的每一个小动物，死于饥饿。设置为0可完全消除腐烂几率。</ALConfigToxicBuildupRotTooltip>
	
	<!-- EN: Young animals are easier to handle -->
  <ALConfigTamingAgeFactorLabel>幼年动物更容易受训</ALConfigTamingAgeFactorLabel>
	<!-- EN: Makes non-adult animals easier to tame and train, effectively reducing their wildness. Proportinal to their relative age - newborn are much easier, while almost adult are barely affected. -->
  <ALConfigTamingAgeFactorTooltip>使幼年动物更容易驯服和训练，有效降低它们的野性，使其与年龄成正比，新生幼崽显著降低，快成年的几乎不受影响。</ALConfigTamingAgeFactorTooltip>

	<!-- Extra stats -->
	
	<!-- EN: Wool type -->
  <WoolType>产毛类型</WoolType>
	<!-- EN: The type of wool this creature will yield when sheared. -->
  <Stat_Race_WoolType_Desc>此动物产毛的类型。</Stat_Race_WoolType_Desc>
	<!-- EN: Wool amount -->
  <WoolAmount>毛产量</WoolAmount>
	<!-- EN: The amount of wool yielded when shearing this creature and time it takes to grow wool. -->
  <Stat_Race_WoolAmount_Desc>此动物单次产毛量及产毛周期。</Stat_Race_WoolAmount_Desc>
	
	<!-- EN: Milk type -->
  <MilkType>产奶类型</MilkType>
	<!-- EN: The type of milk this creature will yield when milked. -->
  <Stat_Race_MilkType_Desc>此动物产奶的类型。</Stat_Race_MilkType_Desc>
	<!-- EN: Milk amount -->
  <MilkAmount>奶产量</MilkAmount>
	<!-- EN: The amount of milk yielded when milking this creature and time it takes to produce milk. -->
  <Stat_Race_MilkAmount_Desc>此动物单次产奶量及产奶周期。</Stat_Race_MilkAmount_Desc>
	<!-- EN: Milk female only -->
  <MilkFemale>仅雌性产奶</MilkFemale>
	<!-- EN: Some species may produce milk regardless of sex, but for most only females can be milked. -->
  <MilkFemaleExplanation>有些动物可以不分性别产奶，但对大多数物种来说，只有雌性才可以产奶。</MilkFemaleExplanation>
	
	<!-- EN: Product type -->
  <AL_ResourceType>产出类型</AL_ResourceType>
	<!-- EN: This animal can produce some type of resource that is not considered milk or wool. Note, that this one can be less reliable since it is used for modded animals with some kind of custom production rules. -->
  <AL_ResourceType_Desc>此动物可以生产一些不被认为是奶或毛的资源。请注意，这些仅存于某些Mod中的动物。</AL_ResourceType_Desc>
	<!-- EN: Product amount -->
  <AL_ResourceAmount>产出量</AL_ResourceAmount>
	<!-- EN: The amount of resource harvested from this creature and time it takes to grow. -->
  <AL_ResourceAmount_Desc>此动物单次产出量及产出周期。</AL_ResourceAmount_Desc>
	
	<!-- EN: Eggs type -->
  <EggType>产蛋类型</EggType>
	<!-- EN: The type of eggs this creature will lay. -->
  <Stat_Race_EggType_Desc>此动物产蛋的类型。</Stat_Race_EggType_Desc>
	<!-- EN: Eggs amount -->
  <EggAmount>蛋产量</EggAmount>
	<!-- EN: The amount of eggs in a clutch and how long it takes to produce them. -->
  <Stat_Race_EggAmount_Desc>此动物单次产蛋量及产蛋周期。</Stat_Race_EggAmount_Desc>
	<!-- EN: Eggs female only -->
  <EggFemale>仅雌性产蛋</EggFemale>
	<!-- EN: Some species may produce eggs regardless of sex, but for most only females can do that. -->
  <EggFemaleExplanation>有些动物可以不分性别产奶，但对大多数物种来说，只有雌性才可以产奶。</EggFemaleExplanation>
	<!-- EN: Eggs must be fertilized -->
  <EggNeedFertilization>仅产受精蛋</EggNeedFertilization>
	<!-- EN: Some species may produce unfertilized eggs, but many others would not. -->
  <EggNeedFertilizationExplanation>有些物种可以产出未受精的蛋，但是大多动物不会这样。</EggNeedFertilizationExplanation>
	<!-- EN: Eggs incubation -->
  <EggIncubation>孵化时间</EggIncubation>
	<!-- EN: How much times it takes for an egg to hatch. -->
  <EggIncubationExplanation>蛋孵化需要的时间。</EggIncubationExplanation>
	
	<!-- EN: Mature age -->
  <TimeToMature>成熟年龄</TimeToMature>
	<!-- EN: How much time it takes to reach reproductive age, age when it can produce milk/wool, or last defined life stage for species that can't reproduce. They are the same age for most species. -->
  <TimeToMatureExplanation>达到能够繁殖的年龄，或能产奶/产毛的年龄，或此物种最后一个生命阶段所需的时间。对于大多数物种来说，这些生命阶段都是同一个。</TimeToMatureExplanation>
	
	<!-- EN: Gestation period -->
  <GestationPeriod>妊娠期</GestationPeriod>
	<!-- EN: How much times it takes to produce a new offspring. -->
  <GestationPeriodExplanation>需要多少时间才能生产一个新的后代。</GestationPeriodExplanation>	
	<!-- EN: Litter size -->
  <LitterSize>同胎生仔数</LitterSize>
	<!-- EN: How many offsprings can be produced at once. -->
  <LitterSizeExplanation>一次能产生多少个后代。</LitterSizeExplanation>

    <!-- Medical Alerts for Animals -->
    <!-- EN: Animal needs treatment -->
  <AnimalNeedsTreatment>动物需要治疗</AnimalNeedsTreatment>
    <!-- EN: Animals need treatment -->
  <AnimalsNeedTreatment>动物需要治疗</AnimalsNeedTreatment>
    <!-- EN: These animals need medical treatment. Without it, they may die of their wounds, or their wounds may become permanent.\n\n{0} -->
  <AnimalNeedsTreatmentDesc>以下动物需要治疗。如果没有及时治疗，动物可能会死于伤口失血，或者会变成永久性伤疤。\n\n{0}</AnimalNeedsTreatmentDesc>

    <!-- EN: Animal needs rescue -->
  <AnimalNeedsRescue>动物需要救援</AnimalNeedsRescue>
    <!-- EN: Animals need rescue -->
  <AnimalsNeedRescue>动物需要救援</AnimalsNeedRescue>
    <!-- EN: These animals are incapacitated on the ground:\n\n{0}\nSend a colonist to rescue them and carry them back to bed.\n\n(To rescue, select a colonist, then right click on the victim and select Rescue.) -->
  <AnimalsNeedRescueDesc>以下动物倒地无法行动:\n\n{0}\n派遣一个殖民者去救援他们，并把动物带回床上。\n\n（如果要救援动物，请选择殖民者，然后右键单击倒地动物并选择救援。）</AnimalsNeedRescueDesc>

    <!-- EN: Medical emergency (animals) -->
  <AnimalsWithLifeThreateningDisease>急救（动物）</AnimalsWithLifeThreateningDisease>
    <!-- EN: Animals are at risk of death because of severe illness:\n\n{0}\nIf possible, consider amputating or replacing infected limbs in order to keep animals alive. -->
  <AnimalsWithLifeThreateningDiseaseAmputationDesc>以下动物有死亡危险：\n\n{0}\n如果可能的话，请考虑截肢或替换受感染的肢体，以此保证动物的存活。</AnimalsWithLifeThreateningDiseaseAmputationDesc>
    <!-- EN: Animals are at risk of death because of severe illness:\n\n{0}\nMake sure that they get the best medical care possible. -->
  <AnimalsWithLifeThreateningDiseaseDesc>以下动物有死亡危险：\n\n{0}\n确保动物得到最好的医疗护理。</AnimalsWithLifeThreateningDiseaseDesc>

</LanguageData>